direction: right
User: User {shape: person}
Edge: Edge proxy {shape: cloud}
Redirect: Redirect service {shape: rectangle}
Create: Link creation API {shape: rectangle}
IDs: ID generator {shape: rectangle}
Cache: URL cache {shape: stored_data}
Links: Link database {shape: cylinder}
Clicks: Click events {shape: queue}
Analytics: Analytics workers {shape: rectangle}
User -> Edge
Edge -> Redirect: short URL
Edge -> Create: create URL
Redirect -> Cache: lookup
Cache -> Links: miss
Create -> IDs
Create -> Links
Redirect -> Clicks
Clicks -> Analytics
